```cobollike
*> 互除法で最大公約数を求める（while がないので、十分大きい回数の for と break で書く）
DEFINE gcd USING a, b.
    PERFORM FUNCTION ADD(a, b) TIMES
        IF b IS EQUAL TO 0 THEN
            EXIT PERFORM.
        END-IF.
        MOVE FUNCTION MOD(a, b) TO t.
        MOVE b TO a.
        MOVE t TO b.
    END-PERFORM.
    RETURN a.
END-DEFINE.
FUNCTION DISPLAY(FUNCTION gcd(48, 18)).
FUNCTION DISPLAY(FUNCTION gcd(17, 5)).
FUNCTION DISPLAY(FUNCTION gcd(0, 7)).
```
